@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.merge
@title Media loading — Merge only
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Merge only
@entry merge-path-change, merge-group-row, merge-group-drop
@summary Show only Merge-specific media-loading paths: Files selection, grouped-item opening, and external files dropped onto a Merge group.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.list-add, functionality.media-loading.common.list-selection, functionality.media-loading.common.viewer, functionality.media-loading.common.drops
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag merge

@alias merge = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PMergeTab
@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup
@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[merge-path-change] Merge Files current-path event <input>
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> merge-path-result

[merge-path-result] Merge selected-path adapter <decision>
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Merge viewer @ merge.PMergePathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Blank current path" > merge-no-request

[merge-no-request] Merge viewer request omitted <output>
= Merge does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.

[merge-group-row] Merge grouped-item selection <input>
- Emit the selected grouped media path from the group row @ group.PGroupFileBuild(...)
- Forward the emitted grouped path through the Merge selected-path adapter @ merge.PMergePathShow(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer

[merge-group-drop] External file drop on Merge group <input>
- Receive a drop on the Merge group area or an existing group card and resolve its file-system paths @ group.PGroupDropHandle(...)
  @ group.PGroupCardHandle(...)
  @ group.PGroupPathsRead(...)
- Invoke the Merge group's file-request delegate, which submits the paths to the Merge Files list before group insertion @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.list-add
